"page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"408":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-13","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#controlled-state-not-updating","content":"Controlled State Not Updating"},"409":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-14","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#trigger-not-expanding-the-panel","content":"Trigger Not Expanding the Panel"},"410":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-15","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#input-values-persist-after-closing","content":"Input Values Persist After Closing"},"411":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-16","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#props","content":"Props"},"412":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-17","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#collapsible","content":"Collapsible"},"413":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-18","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible#collapsiblepanel","content":"CollapsiblePanel"},"414":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-19","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#features","content":"Independent sections with controlled or uncontrolled expansion."},"415":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-20","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#features","content":"Composed headings, optional status icons, and flexible panel content."},"416":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-21","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#features","content":"Persistent panel content when collapsed."},"417":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-22","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#features","content":"Accessible keyboard interaction and button-to-panel relationships powered by React Aria Components."},"418":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-23","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#default","content":"Reveal optional details without an Accordion group."},"419":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-24","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#controlled","content":"Control a section from application state or an external action."},"420":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-25","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#with-status","content":"Pair a status icon with text so completion is understandable without the icon."},"421":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-26","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#disabled","content":"Keep unavailable details disabled, including when their content starts visible."},"422":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-27","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#long-content","content":"Long labels wrap and content grows naturally at narrow widths and larger text sizes."},"423":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-28","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Place a `Heading` containing `Button slot=\"trigger\"` inside Collapsible, followed by CollapsiblePanel.\nAdd an `Icon slot=\"indicator\"` inside the button for the expansion indicator. The panel accepts text,\nlinks, forms, and other components."},"424":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-29","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `defaultExpanded` for initial expansion, or `isExpanded` with `onExpandedChange` for controlled\nstate. The callback receives a boolean. Use Accordion to coordinate several\nsections; in that composition, manage expansion through the group."},"425":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-30","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize each component. Button supports string or state-based\n`className` values. Components expose these data attributes for state-based styling:"},"426":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-31","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."},"427":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-32","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Trigger `Button`: `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."},"428":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-33","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."},"429":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-34","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Choose a Heading level that fits the page hierarchy and use descriptive trigger text. React Aria connects\nthe trigger and panel through `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`, and `aria-labelledby`."},"430":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-35","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Key"},"431":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-36","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Action"},"432":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-37","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"},"433":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-38","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Moves between available controls."},"434":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-39","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"`Enter` / `Space`"},"435":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-40","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Expands or collapses the focused section."},"436":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-41","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Disabled triggers are excluded from the tab order. Collapsed panel content stays mounted but is\nexcluded from keyboard and accessibility navigation. Opening a panel keeps focus on its trigger.\nIf application logic closes a panel containing focus, move focus to a visible control."},"437":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-42","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#accessibility","content":"Keep the indicator decorative with `aria-hidden=\"true\"`. If an optional icon communicates status,\ninclude equivalent text in the label. Place links, inputs, and additional buttons in the panel.\nUse `role=\"region\"` on CollapsiblePanel when its content warrants a named landmark."},"438":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-43","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Use descriptive section titles and keep essential information visible."},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-44","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Keep headings concise and avoid deeply nested sections."},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-45","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Put links, forms, and actions inside the panel."},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-46","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#best-practices","content":"Open the panel before moving focus to an input that needs attention."},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-47","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#controlled-state-not-updating","content":"Update `isExpanded` from `onExpandedChange`. Changing `defaultExpanded` after mounting does not\ncontrol expansion. Inside Accordion, update the group's `expandedKeys` instead."},"443":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-48","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#trigger-not-expanding-the-panel","content":"Place `Button slot=\"trigger\"` inside the section's Heading. A Button without that slot acts\nindependently and does not toggle the section."},"444":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-49","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#input-values-persist-after-closing","content":"Panel content stays mounted when collapsed. Reset form state explicitly when the application requires it."},"445":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker","page_id":"/docs/compone