ists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1740,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[701,"**DOM Output:**"],[1652,"**End**"],[646,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1581,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Anything unslotted is\nleft alone, which is what lets a nested component keep its own internal text. Forget the slot\nand the text simply renders untypeset rather than erroring."],[717,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[705,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[690,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[639,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1323,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[693,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1758,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1770,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1650,"**Home**"],[1773,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1762,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1952,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1943,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[668,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[708,"**In