gle SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[944,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1322,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1542,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[942,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1796,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1738,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1772,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1747,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[696,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1386,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1383,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1392,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1393,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1381,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1387,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1390,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1384,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1396,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[194,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1997,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1999,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1993,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1995,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[2000,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1996,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1994,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1998,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1950,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[582,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1577,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, s