, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[343,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[361,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[339,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[354,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1698,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[426,"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."],[428,"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."],[1910,"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1078,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[671,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[674,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[670,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[672,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[673,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[675,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1374,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`